The '''River Wuitho''' was a river on [[Alderaan]]. It could be seen from the south terrace of the [[House of Organa|Royal Family's]] [[Royal Palace of Alderaan|palace]] in [[Aldera]].<ref name="Leia" />

==Behind the scenes==
River Wuitho appeared in ''[[Leia, Princess of Alderaan]]'', a [[2017]] young-adult novel written by [[Claudia Gray]].<ref name="Leia" />

